{"product_id":"the-pick-of-punch-1992","title":"The pick of Punch, 1992","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"562\"\u003eStep into a time machine that smells faintly of ink, dry humor, and late-20th-century mischief. \u003cem data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"351\"\u003eThe Pick of Punch, 1992\u003c\/em\u003e is not just a book — it’s a curated cocktail of the finest cartoons, satire, and comic commentary from Punch Magazine, the legendary British publication that perfected the art of eyebrow-raising elegance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"971\"\u003eImagine a world before memes, before TikTok humor, before everyone became a comedian on Twitter — when cleverness was the currency and Punch was the bank. This anthology collects the sharpest quips, the funniest sketches, and the most deliciously acerbic commentary published that year. It’s like flipping through a yearbook of British humor… but the students are all geniuses with very pointy pens.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1337\"\u003eWhether you’re a collector, a nostalgia enthusiast, or someone who simply enjoys humor that \u003cem data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1072\"\u003enicks\u003c\/em\u003e rather than \u003cem data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1092\"\u003eslaps\u003c\/em\u003e, this 1992 edition is the perfect bookshelf trophy. It makes a great gift, a delightful coffee-table conversation starter, or a “treat yourself\" moment for anyone who misses the days when satire was subtle and cartoons were clever, not chaotic.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDimensions: 220 x 294\u003cbr\u003eAuthor: David Thomas\u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9780002240604\u003cbr\u003eFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003ePages: 208\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45652478296217,"sku":"12RG9780002240604","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/ID305156.jpg?v=1755532746","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-pick-of-punch-1992","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}